#-------------
BRICK HELMET
#-------------
Stats   - +2 Armor, +1 KB Resist, Break 2%
Bonus   - Limits vision, like a pumpkin!
#-------------
Changes - Craftable by placing 5 bricks in a helmet pattern.
Change Notes - This is essentially a worse version of the football
helmet. It's easy to craft, but that's acceptable because A) it can't
stack, and B) because iron economy lowkey doesn't matter.
This is meant to be the tankiest "basic" armor a zombie can wear.
That may change in the future.
#-------------
